      "raw": "[quote=\"eddie.cardenas\"]\n\nWill there be any way to make some promos more availible some time in the future (like the dark watch characters, or GI bunker. The alternate character cards basically). Because all of the ones i&#39;ve been able to find online are sickingly expensive. And you&#39;d think that they would be able to produce them just as easily as any other card.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThey could easily produce them, but they like to keep the promos exclusive for the people who did the kickstarters/prereleases/special events/ect.\n\nAs Ronway said they plan to release a full promo pack in the future, if you can&#39;t wait check out the various artscow links around the forums and on the reddit page. &nbsp;Or you could just scribble the abilities, hp and incaps on a piece of paper and use that instead.\n",
